port / export code\n0517064821\nAccepted languages\nEnglish, Hindi, Punjabi, Gujarati, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Bengali, Odia, Assamese, Urdu, Arabic (Business Communication)\nMarkets and categories\nMAIN PRODUCTS\n\nBrowse the live catalogue below.\n\nCATEGORIES\n\nCategories follow active listings.\n\nINDUSTRIES SERVED\n\nAsk the supplier about your industry.\n\nPRODUCTION PROFILE\nFactory showcase\n\nFacility, machinery and quality information from the manufacturer profile.\n\nFactory name\nUrbanWood Foods Manufacturing Private Limited\nFactory location\nSriperumbudur, Tamil Nadu, India, 602105\nFloor area\n50,000 Sq. Ft.\nFactory employees\n250\nProduction lines\n8\nMonthly capacity\n25,000+ Furniture Units\nAnnual capacity\n3,00,000+ Furniture Units\n\nUrban Woods Manufacturing Private Limited is a state-of-the-art furniture manufacturing facility located in the industrial heartland of Tamil Nadu, near Chennai \u2013 one of India's most prominent manufacturing hubs. Spanning 85,000 sq. ft. , the factory employs over 380 skilled professionals including designers, carpenters, polishers, upholsterers, CNC operators, and quality assurance experts. The facility operates 12 advanced production lines covering cutting, assembly, polishing, upholstery, modular furniture, and custom/bespoke furniture. With a monthly capacity of 25,000+ units, the factory is equipped with world-class machinery including CNC routers, edge banders, panel saws, spray booths, and advanced material handling systems. The factory features a fully equipped design studio, in-house R&D center, modern finishing section with PU and melamine spraying booths, upholstery section with industrial sewing machines, and a dedicated quality testing laboratory. With global certifications including ISO 9001, FSC Chain of Custody, and BIS, Urban Woods is a trusted partner for leading retailers, interior designers, architects, and corporate clients worldwide. Sustainability initiatives include kiln-drying with solar-assisted heat, 100% water recycling (ZLD), dust extraction and air filtration systems, eco-friendly finishes and adhesives, and FSC-certified wood sourcing. We proudly champion Make in India while serving 30+ export markets with premium furniture solutions.\n\nFactory media has not been published.\n\nCNC Routers, Edge Banding Machines, Panel Saws, Table Saws, Band Saws, Thickness Planers, Jointers, Spindle Moulders, Routing Machines, Drilling Machines, Mortise & Tenon Machines, Sanding Machines (Belt/Disc/Orbital), Spray Booths (Paint/Polish/Varnish), UV Coating Machines, Vacuum Press Machines, Laminate Press Machines, Edge Profilers, Dovetail Machines, Upholstery Sewing Machines, Foam Cutting Machines, Stapling Machines, Assembly Stations, Dust Extraction Systems, Industrial Compressors, Forklifts, Material Handling Equipment, Kiln Drying Chambers, Moisture Meters, Hardness Testers, Adhesive Applicators, Packaging Lines, Stretch Wrapping Machines, Carton Sealers\nQuantity 1\nBUYER ASSURANCE\nProduction and trade capabilities\n\nA consolidated view of customization, quality, logistics and export readiness.\n\nManufacturing services\nOEM servi",
